      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OFF SHORE NZ (5) is a progressive former Kiwi who made a winning start in WA when leading to score by 5 metres at this circuit and distance. Has been kept fresh since but has plenty of upside and could be bound for better things. IDEAL WHISPER (4) is a reliable colt who added to a string of wins and placings when he raced parked but stuck on for third in the Westbred 2CG Classic last start. Led to win at this circuit and distance prior. Big chance. SWEET ROBBIE (2) overcome a tough draw in scoring first-up by 5 metres at Pinjarra. This is stronger but he'll be fitter and is better drawn. TERBIUM (6) must be considered after a string of nice efforts, missing narrowly at Pinjarra four days ago to follow on from his fourth in the Westbred Classic. Include.",
